    <div class="content">
              <h2 >
                  <a class="" href="/security-game?language_id=1" target="_blank" title="Take the Security Quiz here" data-filetype="none">
            <span class="hidden-title">Take the Security Quiz here</span>
            Are you equipped to spot modern cyber threats? Take the security quiz
          </a>
                </h2>
      
      
              <div class="text rich-text" data-module="RichTextContent"
        data-aria-live-text="The next table column has been scrolled into view. Screen reader users can use standard table navigation techniques to navigate the entire table.">
          <div aria-live="assertive"></div>
          <p>How confidently do you navigate today&rsquo;s digital landscape? <br />Test your awareness with our new <strong>Security Quiz</strong>, designed to sharpen your ability to identify phishing attempts, deepfakes, and social engineering tactics such as shock calls. <br />You will be guided through <strong>four realistic, interactive scenarios</strong> where you decide: What is genuine? What should raise suspicion? How would you respond appropriately?</p>
<p>Challenge yourself in situations that mirror real-world threats - and strengthen your ability to make strong decisions in the heat of the moment.</p>
        </div>
      
              <a class="button type-icon icon--bg"
           href="/security-game?language_id=1"
           target="_blank"
           title="Take the Security Quiz here"
                            style=" background-color: #f28011;"
                    >
          <span class="hidden-title">Take the Security Quiz here</span>
          Take the Security Quiz here
        </a>
      
                        
        </div>

          </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
</section>

